# EmailJS config for the contact form (https://www.emailjs.com).
# Copy to .env and fill in. If any is empty, the form falls back to opening a mailto: link.
# The EmailJS template should use these params: {{from_name}}, {{reply_to}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
